--
Single call to the std::views::take adaptor object crashes the front
end: a malformed explicit-typecast (nil type, two nil operands) built
during guess_function_template_args reaches operator_is_overloaded's
conversion-operator branch (to_unary_expr aborts: "unary expression
must have one operand").  Reduced from cpp20_ranges_basic_libcxx.
The same crash masks all preprocessed-libc++ reductions (vector
family).  Runtime-faithful: clang++ -std=c++20 -stdlib=libc++ runs
clean.
